      "at": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-kde.txt#7892-7946",
      "ref": "06-government-legal/un-udhr/udhr-kde.txt",
      "text": "Wasa unang’o ulandane na matulubu la Umoja wa Vilambo."
     }
    ],
